&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Scammers have increasingly used text messages as a means of targeting victims.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
